                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "content": "北行 · 雪落黄河",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                              "fontSize": 26,
                              "fontWeight": "700"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "iqrlK",
                              "name": "Ornament",
                              "gap": 8,
                              "alignItems": "center",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "mtAz9",
                                  "name": "L",
                                  "width": 36,
                                  "height": 1,
                                  "fill": "$stroke-strong"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "icon",
                                  "id": "iFnmn",
                                  "name": "D",
                                  "width": 11,
                                  "height": 11,
                                  "icon": "feather",
                                  "library": "lucide",
                                  "fill": "$text-muted"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "t4NaQV",
                                  "name": "R",
                                  "width": 36,
                                  "height": 1,
                                  "fill": "$stroke-strong"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "XHjiv",
                          "name": "Prose",
                          "width": 640,
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 14,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "iBaw0",
                              "name": "P",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 640,
                              "content": "雪是从黄昏开始落的。沈孤灯牵着马走上渡口时，黄河水汽混着雪片扑面而来，把最后一线天光搅成灰白。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.9,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "xixuQ",
                              "name": "P",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 640,
                              "content": "艄公早已收船。他立在岸边，望着对岸那排隐没在雪幕里的灯——七盏，按照师父临终前留下的方位排开，一盏也不多，一盏也不少。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.9,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "MMGoM",
                              "name": "P",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 640,
                              "content": "「客官要过河？」身后忽然有人开口。那声音很轻，像是踩在雪上。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.9,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "ANIQY",
                              "name": "P",
                              "fill": "$text-secondary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 640,
                              "content": "沈孤灯没有回头。他知道，能在这样的雪夜里无声无息靠近的人，整个河北只有一种。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.9,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "t3Qat",
                              "name": "AI Suggestion Block",
                              "clip": true,
                              "width": 640,
                              "fill": "#B49CFF0D",
                              "cornerRadius": 12,
                              "stroke": "#B49CFF38",
                              "strokeWidth": 1,
                              "layout": "vertical",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "PfNAB",
                                  "name": "AI Head",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
